# Betor, Kin to All: "At the beginning of your end step, if creatures you control have total toughness 10 or greater, draw a card.
# Then if 20 or greater, untap each creature you control. Then if 40 or greater, each opponent loses half their life, rounded up."
# Each step is walked across its boundary: Betor alone (7) and with Ornithopter (9) draws nothing, a Llanowar Elves makes exactly
# 10 and draws; 19 draws but does not untap (Betor attacked and stays tapped), exactly 20 untaps Betor; 39 loses no life and
# exactly 40 makes the opponent, at 21 life, lose 11 (half rounded up) and keep 10. Each later end step halves again, 10, 5, 2, 1
# (rounding up, so one life is lost at one) until the opponent has lost the game.

